      Japanese expressway Service Areas (SA) and Parking Areas (PA), extracted
      from the supplied OpenStreetMap-derived japan_pois.py dataset.
      This file is intended for offline map use in CoMaps.
      OSM data is licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL).
    ]]></description>

